    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d631-a4">

                <pb facs="0712" n="632" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg632"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Canal to Mr. Powell.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Republic of Haiti</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Port au
                                Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-08-12"><hi rendition="#italic">August 12,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Minister</hi>: The Provisional Government has
                    been informed that Mr. Killick, whose rebellion against the order of affairs
                    instituted by the decree of the central committee in May last has been brought
                    to your notice, has declared to be in a state of blockade the port of Cape
                    Haitien, open to foreign commerce.</p>
                <p>This declaration on the part of the ex-admiral is an attempt on the rights that
                    foreign vessels have to enter the ports of the Republic open to commerce and
                    dependent on the legitimate authority.</p>
                <p>The interests of your nationals who have there their places of business must
                    suffer deeply from the execution of that declaration. I have the honor to inform
                        <pb facs="0713" n="633" xml:id="pg633"/> you that the Provisional Government
                    protests energetically against this commencement of violence, in begging you to
                    make thereof a judgment, whereby to dictate to you the means to prevent the
                    accomplishment of such an inconsequence.</p>
                <p>Please accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Boisrond Canal.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
